    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "small breaks dont really do anything though. i take a nap i wake up and it's still there. i take a weekend off and i just come back feeling more drained than before. it's like there is no way to actually fix the emptiness. it just feels like the battery is dead. permanently.",
